            "html": "<div class='sh-wrapper'><div class='sh-bg'><img src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499209974431-9dddcece7f88?q=80&w=2000&auto=format&fit=crop' alt='Hero' /></div><div class='sh-blob sh-blob-1'></div><div class='sh-blob sh-blob-2'></div><div class='sh-content'><div class='sh-reveal'><span class='sh-label'>Offerings of Presence</span></div><h1 class='sh-title sh-reveal sh-delay-1'>The Sacred<br><span class='italic light'>Stillness</span></h1><p class='sh-desc sh-reveal sh-delay-2'>A deliberate return to the center. Not an escape from the world, but a deeper integration into it.</p><div class='sh-reveal sh-delay-3'><a href='#sacred_curated_calm_section' class='sh-btn'><span class='sh-btn-bg'></span><span class='sh-btn-text'>Begin the Journey</span><i class='fas fa-arrow-right sh-btn-icon'></i></a></div></div><div class='sh-bottom-stats sh-reveal sh-delay-3'><div class='sh-stats-left'><div>43\u00b0 N / 79\u00b0 W</div><div>Canada's First Sanctuary</div></div><div class='sh-stats-right'><span>Scroll</span><div class='sh-scroll-line'><div class='sh-scroll-fill'></div></div></div></div></div><style>.sh-wrapper { position: relative; width: 100%; overflow: hidden; height: 100vh; min-height: 800px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background-color: #1D3152; color: #FFFFFF !important; } .sh-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: 0.4; pointer-events: none; } .sh-bg img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(100%) brightness(50%); } .sh-blob { position: absolute; border-radius: 9999px; pointer-events: none; } .sh-blob-1 { top: 25%; left: 40px; width: 256px; height: 256px; background: rgba(104, 143, 157, 0.2); filter: blur(64px); animation: sh-breathe 8s ease-in-out infinite; } .sh-blob-2 { bottom: 25%; right: 40px; width: 384px; height: 384px; background: rgba(217, 232, 235, 0.1); filter: blur(64px); animation: sh-breathe 8s ease-in-out infinite 2s; } .sh-content { position: relative; z-index: 10; text-align: center; padding: 0 24px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; } .sh-label { display: inline-block; color: #688F9D !important; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 32px; font-weight: 700; font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important; } .sh-title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important; font-size: 96px !important; line-height: 0.9 !important; color: #FFFFFF !important; margin: 0 0 32px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.02em; } .sh-title .italic { font-style: italic; } .sh-title .light { font-weight: 400; } .sh-desc { font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6) !important; max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto 48px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 18px; } .sh-btn { position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 16px; padding: 20px 40px; text-decoration: none !important; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 99px; outline: none; transition: all 0.5s ease; color: #FFFFFF !important; font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important; } .sh-btn:hover { color: #1D3152 !important; text-decoration: none !important; } .sh-btn:focus, .sh-btn:active { outline: none; box-shadow: none; } .sh-btn-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: 99px; transition: all 0.5s ease; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(4px); } .sh-btn:hover .sh-btn-bg { transform: scale(1.05); background: #FFFFFF; } .sh-btn-text { position: relative; z-index: 1; color: #FFFFFF !important; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; transition: color 0.5s ease; } .sh-btn:hover .sh-btn-text { color: #1D3152 !important; } .sh-btn-icon { position: relative; z-index: 1; color: #688F9D !important; font-size: 14px; transition: all 0.5s ease; } .sh-btn:hover .sh-btn-icon { transform: translateX(8px); color: #1D3152 !important; } .sh-bottom-stats { position: absolute; bottom: 48px; left: 0; right: 0; padding: 0 48px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; opacity: 0.4; color: #FFFFFF !important; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; z-index: 10; font-weight: 700; font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif !important; } .sh-stats-left { display: flex; gap: 48px; } .sh-stats-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; } .sh-scroll-line { width: 48px; height: 2px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); position: relative; } .sh-scroll-fill { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; height: 100%; width: 33%; background: #688F9D; } @keyframes sh-breathe { 0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.8; } 50% { transform: scale(1.1); opacity: 1; } } .sh-reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); animation: sh-fade-up 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) forwards; } .sh-delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.2s; } .sh-delay-2 { animation-delay: 0.4s; } .sh-delay-3 { animation-delay: 0.6s; } @keyframes sh-fade-up { to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } } @media (min-width: 1025px) { .sh-title { font-size: 128px !important; line-height: 0.9 !important; } } @media (max-width: 767px) { .sh-title { font-size: 60px !important; } .sh-bottom-stats { padding: 0 24px; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 24px; text-align: center; } .sh-stats-left { gap: 24px; flex-direction: column; } }</style>"
